// 抚蛮：每个出牌阶段向每名其他角色各赠一张手牌并追踪；追踪牌视为杀，结算后按伤害摸牌。
skill twfuman(2838266052) {
  modifier card_name(skill_tracked) override sha;
  active play_phase targets 1 1 other unused_by_skill_this_play_phase select_hand 1 1 {
    effect resolve_twfuman(self, event_source, 0);
  }
  trigger sha_resolved owner_alive_other_sha_resolved_tracked_skill_card_dealt_damage {
    effect draw_cards(self, 2);
    effect resolve_twfuman(self, event_source, 1);
  }
  trigger sha_resolved owner_alive_other_sha_resolved_tracked_skill_card_no_damage {
    effect draw_cards(self, 1);
    effect resolve_twfuman(self, event_source, 1);
  }
  trigger card_responded owner_alive_other_twkujian_used_or_responded {
    effect draw_cards(self, 1);
    effect resolve_twfuman(self, event_source, 1);
  }
  trigger cards_moved owner_tracked_skill_card_left_hand_not_use_or_respond {
    effect resolve_twfuman(self, event_source, 2);
  }
}